(7735450, 1275088, 141319, '<td valign="top">I expected to see things "at a distance" in this challenge, not "close up - just my take on it. S/he is very cute though</td>', 'I expected to see things "at a distance" in this challenge, not "close up - just my take on it. S/he is very cute though', '2022-12-25 13:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
