(7735452, 1275123, 141319, '<td valign="top">To me this is not "at a distance" - I get it that you probably weren''t following in an airplane, but for the challenge I am "expecting" to see things further away. That''s just my interpretation.<br/>Are those things on the wings tags?</td>', 'To me this is not "at a distance" - I get it that you probably weren''t following in an airplane, but for the challenge I am "expecting" to see things further away. That''s just my interpretation.Are those things on the wings tags?', '2022-12-25 13:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
