(7736004, 1275120, 124815, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 10s. I disagree only with your own comment:<br/><i>phone photo .. terrible quality .. the only way I felt it could work was with added grain .. would''ve loved it to be clean and sharp .. :( </i> <br/>A talented one could write a story by looking at this</td>', 'I was one of your 10s. I disagree only with your own comment:phone photo .. terrible quality .. the only way I felt it could work was with added grain .. would''ve loved it to be clean and sharp .. :(  A talented one could write a story by looking at this', '2023-01-02 21:21:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7736005, 1274985, 124815, '<td valign="top">It was 8 from me and forgot to revisit my scores or it would have been 9.<br/>I would have never guessed that it''s Italy - never made it North of Milano - but took the marvelous train several times from Switzerland. Magical</td>', 'It was 8 from me and forgot to revisit my scores or it would have been 9.I would have never guessed that it''s Italy - never made it North of Milano - but took the marvelous train several times from Switzerland. Magical', '2023-01-02 21:25:23.000000', NULL, 0),
