(7736011, 1275131, 98565, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely cene, perfekt for the challenge.<br/>I like the balance between the warm colours in sky and lake and the cool tones of the city</td>', 'Such a lovely cene, perfekt for the challenge.I like the balance between the warm colours in sky and lake and the cool tones of the city', '2023-01-03 03:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7736012, 1275133, 98565, '<td valign="top">You''re the queen of seascapes! Gorgeous!</td>', 'You''re the queen of seascapes! Gorgeous!', '2023-01-03 03:06:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7736013, 1275112, 98565, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful. The little path is also adding to the scene, gives a feeling of how majestic the landscape really is</td>', 'Just wonderful. The little path is also adding to the scene, gives a feeling of how majestic the landscape really is', '2023-01-03 03:09:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7736014, 1275120, 98565, '<td valign="top">Don''t worry about the quality Roz - the story that is transported by this shot is supported by the look. Very well done!</td>', 'Don''t worry about the quality Roz - the story that is transported by this shot is supported by the look. Very well done!', '2023-01-03 03:13:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7736015, 1274985, 98565, '<td valign="top">Lovely take on the distance theme, Anthony! I also love the reflection of the mountains.<br/> <br/>And thank you for sharing the story and the thoughts about the "right" gear. Ins''t there a saying, that a talented photographer can make interesting pictures with any camera whereas the best gear doesn''t help if the photographer is not qualified?</td>', 'Lovely take on the distance theme, Anthony! I also love the reflection of the mountains. And thank you for sharing the story and the thoughts about the "right" gear. Ins''t there a saying, that a talented photographer can make interesting pictures with any camera whereas the best gear doesn''t help if the photographer is not qualified?', '2023-01-03 03:21:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7736016, 1275134, 98565, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a scene!<br/>I wonder if the person this message was meant for also had a drone... ?<br/>;-)<br/></td>', 'Wow, what a scene!I wonder if the person this message was meant for also had a drone... ?;-)', '2023-01-03 03:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
